{"version":"0.1.0","license":"propriétaire","license_files":["MIT-hsk30.txt","UNICODE-LICENSE.txt","MIT-cjk-decomp.txt"],"source":"liste HSK 3.0 (GF 0025-2021) : caractères data/sources/listes/hsk-*.txt, mots data/sources/listes/hsk-mots.tsv (ivankra/hsk30, MIT) ; pinyin des caractères d'Unihan ; décomposition GF 0014-2009 réconciliée par le pipeline wenlu ; sens et exemples rédigés pour l'app et relus","source_url":"https://github.com/jon-gyt/zilin","modified":"2026-09-30 : assemblé par `wenlu export`","lot":2,"entrees":{"逼":{"c":"逼","pinyin":"bī","lectures":["bī"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["辶","一","口","田"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L6-0036","L7-0156","L7-0157","L7-0158"],"chemin":{"hsk":759,"lire":752},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"forcer, contraindre","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"forcer, contraindre, acculer"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"没有人逼你，是你自己要来的。","pinyin":"Méiyǒu rén bī nǐ, shì nǐ zìjǐ yào lái de.","fr":"Personne ne t'y a obligé, c'est toi qui as voulu venir.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"鼻":{"c":"鼻","pinyin":"bí","lectures":["bí"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["自","田","丌"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0025","L7-0159"],"chemin":{"hsk":631,"lire":624},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"nez","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"nez"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"小狗的鼻子很灵。","pinyin":"Xiǎo gǒu de bízi hěn líng.","fr":"Le petit chien a un flair très fin.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"彼":{"c":"彼","pinyin":"bǐ","lectures":["bǐ"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["彳","皮"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0028","L7-0626"],"chemin":{"hsk":618,"lire":611},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"celui-là, l'autre","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Pron","fr":"celui-là, l'autre (langue écrite)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他们彼此帮助。","pinyin":"Tāmen bǐcǐ bāngzhù.","fr":"Ils s'entraident.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"比":{"c":"比","pinyin":"bǐ","lectures":["bǐ"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["匕","匕"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0024","L2-0018","L2-0019","L3-0037","L3-0038","L3-0039","L3-0786","L4-0036","L4-0206","L5-0026","L5-0027","L7-0051","L7-0160","L7-0161","L7-0162","L7-0163","L7-0164","L7-1587","L7-4355","L7-4513","L7-4656"],"chemin":{"hsk":103,"lire":98},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"comparer, que (comparatif)","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我比他大两岁。","pinyin":"Wǒ bǐ tā dà liǎng suì.","fr":"J'ai deux ans de plus que lui.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"今天比昨天冷。","pinyin":"Jīntiān bǐ zuótiān lěng.","fr":"Il fait plus froid aujourd'hui qu'hier.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 比 montre deux hommes côte à côte, tournés du même côté. Le Shuowen jiezi le glose par « serré, rapproché » et le décrit comme 从 retourné. Du sens de « rapprocher » on est passé à celui de « comparer », et les deux hommes sont devenus deux formes proches de 匕.","en":"On oracle bones, 比 shows two men side by side, facing the same way. The Shuowen jiezi glosses it as “close together” and describes it as 从 turned around. From “to bring close” the sense moved to “to compare”, and the two men have become two shapes close to 匕.","roles":{}}},"笔":{"c":"笔","pinyin":"bǐ","lectures":["bǐ"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["⺮","毛"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0020","L2-0021","L2-0022","L5-0262","L5-0494","L6-0037","L6-0645","L6-1009","L7-0691"],"chemin":{"hsk":224,"lire":124},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"pinceau, stylo","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你有笔吗？","pinyin":"Nǐ yǒu bǐ ma?","fr":"Tu as un stylo ?","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 聿 montre une main qui tient un pinceau. Le Shuowen jiezi enregistre 筆, qui ajoute le bambou ⺮ à 聿, le manche du pinceau étant en bambou. La forme 笔, forme populaire retenue par la simplification, remplace 聿 par 毛, les poils : un manche de bambou et une pointe de poils.","en":"On oracle bones, 聿 shows a hand holding a brush. The Shuowen jiezi records 筆, which adds bamboo ⺮ to 聿, since the handle of the brush was made of bamboo. The form 笔, a popular variant adopted by simplification, replaces 聿 with 毛, hair: a bamboo handle and a tip of hair.","roles":{"⺮":"sens","毛":"sens"}}},"鄙":{"c":"鄙","pinyin":"bǐ","lectures":["bǐ"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","十","囗","口","阝"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L7-0126","L7-0165"],"chemin":{"hsk":919,"lire":912},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"vil, grossier ; mépriser","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"vil, grossier"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"mépriser, dédaigner"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"壁":{"c":"壁","pinyin":"bì","lectures":["bì"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["尸","口","辛","土"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0273","L5-0590","L7-0171","L7-1302"],"chemin":{"hsk":619,"lire":612},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"mur, paroi","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"mur, paroi, falaise"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"墙壁上挂着很多照片。","pinyin":"Qiángbì shang guà zhe hěn duō zhàopiàn.","fr":"Il y a beaucoup de photos accrochées au mur.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"币":{"c":"币","pinyin":"bì","lectures":["bì"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["丿","巾"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L3-0591","L6-0835","L7-1839","L7-5025"],"chemin":{"hsk":348,"lire":345},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"monnaie","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"monnaie, devise"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"弊":{"c":"弊","pinyin":"bì","lectures":["bì"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["㡀","𠂉","乂","卄"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0169","L7-0170","L7-5627"],"chemin":{"hsk":922,"lire":915},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"abus, inconvénient ; fraude","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"abus, inconvénient ; fraude"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"必":{"c":"必","pinyin":"bì","lectures":["bì"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L2-0023","L3-0040","L3-0041","L3-0056","L4-0755","L5-0029","L5-0030","L6-0038","L6-0039","L7-0166","L7-0167","L7-1616","L7-3730","L7-4402"],"chemin":{"hsk":239,"lire":248},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"forcément, nécessairement","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adv","fr":"forcément, nécessairement"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他明天必来。","pinyin":"Tā míngtiān bì lái.","fr":"Il viendra sans faute demain.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"mnemotechnique","fr":"Pour s'en souvenir : 必 ressemble à 心, le cœur, traversé d'un trait en biais. Un cœur marqué d'un trait, comme une décision prise. Ce qui est décidé arrivera : 必 veut dire « forcément ».","en":"As a memory aid: 必 looks like 心, the heart, crossed by a slanting stroke. A heart marked by a stroke, like a decision that has been made. What is decided will happen: 必 means “certainly, must”.","roles":{}}},"毕":{"c":"毕","pinyin":"bì","lectures":["bì"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["匕","匕","十"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0037","L4-0038","L5-0031","L7-4244"],"chemin":{"hsk":483,"lire":476},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"finir, achever","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"finir, achever, terminer"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"毙":{"c":"毙","pinyin":"bì","lectures":["bì"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["匕","匕","歹","匕"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3279"],"chemin":{"hsk":920,"lire":913},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"mourir ; tuer, abattre","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"mourir ; tuer, abattre"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"痹":{"c":"痹","pinyin":"bì","lectures":["bì"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["疒","田","丌"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-2763"],"chemin":{"hsk":920,"lire":913},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"paralysie, 